Description:
    Generate controllers and views for the audited gem.

Example:
    bin/rails generate audited:ui

    This will create:
        app/controllers/audits_controller.rb
        app/helpers/audits_helper.rb
        app/views/audits/_filters.html.erb
        app/views/audits/index.html.erb
        config/locales/audited.en.yml
        config/locales/audited.es.yml
